{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WNYnH5U1YeH96WHnJPvnTv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the full paper (11 pages) and the review context YAML. Let me summarize what I have before dispatching reviewers.\n\n**Paper Summary:**\n- Title: \"Multi-Class Annotation Errors Are Not Created Equal: Bias Taxonomy, Sensitivity Analysis, and Correction Guidance for LLM-Annotated Causal Studies\"\n- 3 contributions: (1) bias taxonomy across 6 DAG topologies for K≥3, (2) ASV sensitivity framework, (3) correction guidance framework + toolkit\n- Key finding: exposure misclassification is uniquely dangerous (85% reversal rate), other 5 topologies are \"well-behaved\"\n\n\n- Theory-practice alignment is strong at 76%, though ASV monotonicity breaks down for colliders and front-door structures\n- Empirical validation spans three LLMs across three annotation tasks with nearly 270K annotations, showing consistent diagonal dominance\n- The correction framework achieves 78% accuracy with maximum likelihood adjustment dominating at 65%, and they've released an installable toolkit for sensitivity analysis\n\nThe main limitations are that theory-MC matching degrades on complex topologies, the empirical correlations are too diagonal-dominant to be discriminative, and the correction framework essentially defaults to recommending MLA without much nuance. Now I'm setting up two parallel reviewers—one focused on methods and experiments, another on novelty and related work—then I'll synthesize their assessments in a roundtable discussion.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14156,"cache_read_input_tokens":40931,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14156},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"045397bc-4678-4c04-b09d-1cdc407a641d","uuid":"e0c79b59-6fad-456d-b01a-4cea8c6dcb5e"}
