{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UQjHcjPFURsx9ewNR9kw1c","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod_0510/projects/causal_annot_error_attrib/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# causal_annot_error_attrib — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 07:40 UTC | 更新原因: Exposure DAG 确认方向反转，Version A framing 成立，更新进展和风险\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n多分类 LLM 标注误差在因果推断中的偏差传播：推导 K×K 混淆矩阵在 6 种 DAG 拓扑下的偏差表达式，构建 Annotation Sensitivity Values (ASVs) 灵敏度分析框架。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段：Research（MVP 2026-05-20 通过）\\\\n\\\\n### 核心假设验证状态\\\\n- ✅ **方向反转已确认（D004）**：Exposure DAG K=3 — 85% random C 违反 bias-toward-null，83.4% 符号反转\\\\n- ✅ **二分类保证仍成立**：K=2 exposure DAG 6/6 toward null\\\\n- ✅ **拓扑依赖性验证**：Confounding DAG 单调 vs Exposure DAG 不可预测\\\\n- ✅ **折叠损失**：K=3 vs binary Δ up to 0.103\\\\n- → **Version A framing 确认**（D003 checkpoint resolved）\\\\n\\\\n### Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: AAAI 2027（abstract 2026-07-21, paper 2026-07-28, ~62 天）\\\\n- Secondary: ARR October 2026（→ NAACL/ACL 2027）\\\\n\\\\n### Core Claims（详见 paper_framing.md）\\\\n1. Multi-class bias taxonomy — 6 DAG 拓扑 × K×K 混淆矩阵结构交互（**核心已验证**）\\\\n2. Annotation Sensitivity Values (ASVs) — 标注误差灵敏度分析\\\\n3. Correction guidance framework — 诊断驱动的纠偏方法选择\\\\n\\\\n### 实验覆盖（详见 experiment_plan.yaml）\\\\n- P0: plan_001(6 DAG K=3), plan_003(3 LLM实证), plan_004(ASV证明), plan_006(ASV实证), plan_008(二分类折叠)\\\\n- P1: plan_002(K=5,7), plan_005(ASV扩展), plan_007(纠偏框架), plan_010(工具包)\\\\n- P2: plan_009(病态C分析)\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- ✅ MVP 通过（D001）— confounding DAG 框架验证\\\\n- ✅ Exposure DAG 方向反转确认（D002/D004）— Claim 1 最强形式成立\\\\n- ✅ paper_framing.md 双版本 → Version A 确认\\\\n- ✅ experiment_plan.yaml 10 个实验\\\\n- ⏳ Dream 模拟运行中（dream_20260520T072911，full review）\\\\n- ⏳ 等 Dream 回调后审批 P0 实验\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 评估 framing/plan 是否需调整\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后：派 Agent 启动 plan_001（剩余 4 canonical DAG 拓扑推导 + MC）\\\\n- [ ] 并行：plan_003 金标数据获取确认（ACLED ToS / SemEval / Civil Comments）\\\\n- [ ] 并行：plan_003 API key 准备（Llama 4 / Qwen 3.5 / DeepSeek V4）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n本项目 GPU 需求极低（总计 15-30h）。当前 0 GPU 分配。\\\\n服务器：home-1x5090（sonny），已绑定但未部署项目代码。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. ~~方向反转是否出现~~ → ✅ 已确认（exposure DAG 85%）\\\\n2. Lee & Wood-Doughty (2024) 重叠 → 已区分 observed vs unobserved confounding\\\\n3. AAAI DDL 62 天 → 关键路径：plan_001(~5d) → plan_004(~7d) → plan_006(~3d)，留 ~47 天写论文\\\\n4. plan_004 ASV sharpness 证明可能卡住 → 退路：MC-validated conjectures（framing 已预留）\\\\n5. Brenner (1993) 精确引用需核实 → 论文撰写时处理\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-20 | D003 checkpoint 提前解决：Version A 成立，exposure DAG K=3 | art_20260520_207c62, art_20260520_f08c30 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-20 | plan_001 完成后设 checkpoint gate：方向反转拓扑数 → framing 版本 | plan_001 |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | Research 阶段第一优先级：exposure misclassification DAG K= | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP PASS — Confounding DAG K=3 理论框架验证通过，进入 researc | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2489, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HZPBc9JxinXGyzkAPBKQ7v","session_id":"045397bc-4678-4c04-b09d-1cdc407a641d","uuid":"e76c8f7e-a688-4018-8eb8-9b2907949d9d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:57:53.144Z"}
